---
// BentoServices.astro - Acto 4: La Máquina 360° con Netflix Spotlight Banner + Grid Bento Compacto e Interactivo
---

<section id="servicios" class="relative py-20 sm:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-[#090D16]">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Header with Mono Counter -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-10 gap-6">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="h-px w-8 bg-brand-cyan"></div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-cyan tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold">
            02 / CAPACIDAD INTEGRAL ALL-IN-ONE
          </span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-extrabold text-3xl sm:text-5xl text-white tracking-tight uppercase">
          La Máquina 360° de <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
          <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-cyan to-brand-light">
            Experiencias Vivas.
          </span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="font-body text-slate-400 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-md leading-relaxed">
        Todo el ciclo resuelto con equipamiento propio y dirección creativa in-house. Cero fricción de coordinar múltiples proveedores.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 🎬 NETFLIX-STYLE SPOTLIGHT BANNER (Línea Insignia: Eventos Corporativos & BTL) -->
    <div class="relative w-full rounded-3xl bg-[#0B111D] border border-white/10 shadow-beautiful-lg overflow-hidden mb-8 group">
      <!-- Ambient Glow in Corners -->
      <div class="absolute -left-20 -top-20 w-80 h-80 bg-brand-cyan/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute -right-20 -bottom-20 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-blue/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-stretch min-h-[440px] lg:min-h-[480px]">
        
        <!-- LEFT SIDE: Netflix-Style Editorial Content -->
        <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 flex flex-col justify-center z-20">
          <!-- Netflix Brand Tag / Ribbon -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-3.5">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand-cyan to-brand-blue font-display font-black text-xs text-white shadow-glow-cyan">
              S
            </span>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-cyan font-bold">
              PRODUCCIÓN INSIGNIA • TOP 1 EN EVENTOS
            </span>
          </div>

          <!-- Headline Display Grotesk -->
          <h3 class="font-display font-black text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-[2.35rem] text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.12] mb-3.5 uppercase drop-shadow-[0_4px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)]">
            CONVENCIONES, GALAS <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
            <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-cyan via-brand-light to-white">
              & FIESTAS CORPORATIVAS.
            </span>
          </h3>

          <!-- Netflix-Style Metadata Line -->
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 sm:gap-2.5 mb-4 font-mono text-xs">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold tracking-wider">99% Recomendado</span>
            <span class="text-slate-600">•</span>
            <span class="text-slate-300">2026</span>
            <span class="text-slate-600">•</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-slate-200 font-semibold text-[11px]">100% IN-HOUSE</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-slate-200 font-semibold text-[11px]">4K ULTRA HD</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brand-cyan/15 border border-brand-cyan/30 text-brand-cyan font-semibold text-[11px]">+2,500 PAX</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Synopsis Description (Concise & punchy) -->
          <p class="font-body text-slate-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-lg mb-6 drop-shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.7)]">
            Puestas en escena masivas con pantallas LED gigantes, iluminación robótica de concierto y sonido envolvente. Diseñamos experiencias que rompen la inercia corporativa y transforman tu evento en el acontecimiento del año.
          </p>

          <!-- Action Buttons -->
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
            <!-- Play Button (White solid) -->
            <button
              type="button"
              data-video-src="/videos/megalabs-fiesta-web.mp4"
              data-video-title="Sónica Perú | Mega Fiesta & Concierto Megalabs"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 font-bold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl transition-all transform hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98] shadow-beautiful-md group cursor-pointer"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current text-slate-900 group-hover:text-brand-cyan transition-colors" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M8 5v14l11-7z" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold tracking-wide">Ver Showreel</span>
            </button>

            <!-- Secondary Action -->
            <a
              href="#contacto"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-surface/80 hover:bg-surface-elevated text-white border border-white/15 hover:border-brand-cyan/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl backdrop-blur-md transition-all text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold"
            >
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-cyan" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
              </svg>
              <span>Cotizar BTL</span>
            </a>

            <!-- Mute / Unmute Toggle Button for ambient video -->
            <button
              type="button"
              id="netflix-mute-toggle"
              aria-label="Activar o desactivar sonido del video"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-surface/80 hover:bg-surface-elevated text-slate-300 hover:text-white border border-white/15 transition-all hover:scale-105"
              title="Activar audio de fondo"
            >
              <svg id="netflix-mute-icon" class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <polygon points="11 5 6 9 2 9 2 15 6 15 11 19 11 5" />
                <line x1="23" y1="9" x2="17" y2="15" />
                <line x1="17" y1="9" x2="23" y2="15" />
              </svg>
              <svg id="netflix-unmute-icon" class="w-4 h-4 hidden text-brand-cyan" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <polygon points="11 5 6 9 2 9 2 15 6 15 11 19 11 5" />
                <path d="M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14M15.54 8.46a5 5 0 0 1 0 7.07" />
              </svg>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- RIGHT SIDE: The Cinematic Video with Shorter & Left-Shifted Feather Gradient -->
        <div class="relative w-full lg:w-1/2 min-h-[300px] sm:min-h-[380px] lg:min-h-full flex-1 overflow-hidden self-stretch">
          <video
            id="netflix-spotlight-video"
            autoplay
            muted
            loop
            playsinline
            poster="/posters/fiesta.webp"
            class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center filter brightness-[0.96] contrast-[1.10]"
          >
            <source src="/videos/megalabs-fiesta-web.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          </video>

          <!-- Left Feathering Gradient: Shorter (w-10 to w-20) and anchored slightly more to the left (-left-2) -->
          <div class="absolute inset-y-0 -left-2 w-10 sm:w-16 lg:w-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0B111D] via-[#0B111D]/60 to-transparent pointer-events-none z-10"></div>

          <!-- Top, Bottom, and Right Feather Gradients (subtle and tight) -->
          <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-10 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0B111D]/80 to-transparent pointer-events-none z-10"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-14 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0B111D]/80 to-transparent pointer-events-none z-10"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-y-0 right-0 w-8 bg-gradient-to-l from-[#0B111D]/40 to-transparent pointer-events-none z-10"></div>

          <!-- Live Production Badge on top right of video -->
          <div class="absolute top-3.5 right-3.5 sm:top-5 sm:right-5 z-20 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-black/65 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300 pointer-events-none">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red-500 animate-pulse"></span>
            <span class="uppercase tracking-wider text-[10px]">Fiesta Megalabs • Concierto Real</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ⚡ COMPACT BENTO GRID (Con estilo & animación única por tarjeta) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-5">
      
      <!-- CARD 02: Branding & Escenografía Efímera (Architecture Blueprint Grid Reveal) -->
      <div class="gradient-border-card md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2 p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col justify-between group overflow-hidden relative shadow-beautiful-md">
        <!-- Unique Style: Architectural Blueprint Grid that reveals on hover -->
        <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#00b2fe0f_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#00b2fe0f_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:18px_18px] pointer-events-none rounded-2xl"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3.5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-brand-blue/20 border border-brand-blue/30 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-3 transition-transform duration-300">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path d="M4 21v-7m0 0V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h12a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10m-16 0h16m0 0v7M9 7h6" />
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-cyan/80 bg-brand-cyan/10 border border-brand-cyan/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">
                [ 3D CAD • STANDS ]
              </span>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-500">02 / 06</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-white mb-1.5 group-hover:text-brand-cyan transition-colors">
            Branding & Escenografía Efímera
          </h3>
          <p class="font-body text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
            Stands feriales de arquitectura efímera, tótems táctiles interactivos y letras corpóreas para minería, agro y retail.
          </p>
        </div>

        <a href="#contacto" class="relative z-10 pt-3.5 mt-3 border-t border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono group/link">
          <span class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">SGS, Rendipel, Urbana Perú</span>
          <span class="text-brand-cyan flex items-center gap-1 group-hover/link:translate-x-1 transition-transform">
            <span>Cotizar Escenografía</span>
            <svg class="w-3 h-3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- CARD 03: Merchandising de Élite (Metallic Shimmer Light Sweep) -->
      <div class="gradient-border-card md:col-span-1 lg:col-span-1 p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col justify-between group overflow-hidden relative shadow-beautiful-md">
        <!-- Unique Style: Angled Shimmer Light Sweep across the card on hover -->
        <div class="absolute inset-0 -translate-x-full group-hover:translate-x-full transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/[0.08] to-transparent pointer-events-none -skew-x-12"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3.5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/25 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:border-amber-400/50 transition-all duration-300">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z" />
                  <polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96" />
                  <line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12" />
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-300/80 bg-amber-400/10 border border-amber-400/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">
                [ VIP FINISH ]
              </span>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-500">03 / 06</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-white mb-1.5 group-hover:text-amber-200 transition-colors">
            Merchandising de Élite & Trofeos
          </h3>
          <p class="font-body text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Trofeos de autor en acrílico/madera noble, kits de bienvenida VIP y ropa técnica corporativa duradera.
          </p>
        </div>

        <a href="#contacto" class="relative z-10 pt-3.5 mt-3 border-t border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono group/link">
          <span class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">Natura, Avon, Pisco</span>
          <span class="text-amber-300/90 flex items-center gap-1 group-hover/link:translate-x-1 transition-transform">
            <span>Cotizar</span>
            <svg class="w-3 h-3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- CARD 04: Producción Audiovisual (Live REC Indicator & Soundwave Visualizer) -->
      <div class="gradient-border-card md:col-span-1 lg:col-span-1 p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col justify-between group overflow-hidden relative shadow-beautiful-md">
        <!-- Subtle cine corner viewfinder marks -->
        <div class="absolute top-2.5 left-2.5 w-2 h-2 border-t border-l border-white/20 group-hover:border-brand-cyan/50 transition-colors pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 w-2 h-2 border-t border-r border-white/20 group-hover:border-brand-cyan/50 transition-colors pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-2.5 left-2.5 w-2 h-2 border-b border-l border-white/20 group-hover:border-brand-cyan/50 transition-colors pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-2.5 right-2.5 w-2 h-2 border-b border-r border-white/20 group-hover:border-brand-cyan/50 transition-colors pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3.5">
